steps.text:
I can't create work streams, so I've sent your request to Cascade, the squad manager, to open one. The message includes a proposed title ("Migrate the docs site to Astro") and a description. It notes that Noah wants this done this quarter.

I also listed a few open items for planning:
- the docs site's current location in the repository;
- the URLs and redirects that must keep working;
- how search is handled;
- the deployment and CI changes needed;
- whether there is a hard deadline inside the quarter.

Cascade will pick the flow and delivery policy.

